00:58:41.110 --> 00:58:51.770
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight from Mr. Torey Malatia, who came up to me earlier and asked, [VOICE OF NICK HORNBY] "OK, I'm not being rude, but what do you do in this team?"

00:58:51.770 --> 00:58:57.310
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.

00:58:57.310 --> 00:59:02.310
